    },
    {
      "claim_type": "structural_responsibility",
      "scope": {
        "type": "module",
        "module": "flash_state"
      },
      "summary": "flash_state 根据内部状态（r_state）和输入条件（i_startRead, r_start_spi）生成 SPI 主控制器的使能信号（w_spi_en），并输出片选信号（w_spi_cs_n）作为事务完成标志（o_finish）。",
      "subject": "SPI 事务状态控制",
      "explanation": "赋值依赖显示 w_spi_en 在 READ 或 PAGE_PRO 状态下由 i_startRead 或 r_start_spi 触发，否则仅由 r_start_spi 触发。o_finish 直接跟随 w_spi_cs_n，表明片选信号下降沿表示事务结束。",
      "signals": [
        "w_spi_en",
        "o_finish",
        "w_spi_cs_n",
        "i_startRead",
        "r_start_spi"
